OL,3,GNEWSAVeteran who forgot he played
OL,4,Alottery wins #500k
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn army veteran said he was stunned to
OL,7,Fwin #500,000 on the Postcode Lottery -
OL,8,Fbecause he had forgotten he still
OL,9,Fplayed it.
OL,11,FRick Robinson, from Street in Somerset,
OL,12,Fsaid he thought the call telling him he
OL,13,Fhad won was a joke until he later
OL,14,Fdiscovered he had won #250,000 on each
OL,15,Fof his two tickets.
OL,17,FRobinson, 58, said he "totally forgot"
OL,18,Fhe was still playing the competition
OL,19,Fand only believed it when he checked
OL,20,Fhis bank account for the direct debit.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
