OL,3,GNEWSAVeteran who forgot he played
OL,4,Alottery wins #500k
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I thought it was a joke initially when
OL,7,FI got a call from someone claiming to
OL,8,Fbe from Postcode Lottery and they said,
OL,9,F'You've won a prize'. I thought, 'No, I
OL,10,Fhaven't'," Robinson, one of eight
OL,11,Fwinners in Street, said.
